sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor User
  participant UI as Svelte UI
  participant Cmd as Tauri command
  participant Svc as Export service
  participant FF as FFmpeg
  participant Probe as ffprobe
  participant FS as Filesystem

  User->>UI: Export
  UI->>Cmd: validate_export
  Cmd->>Svc: Validate snapshot/path/assets/disk
  Svc-->>UI: validation
  UI->>Cmd: start_export
  Cmd->>Svc: Create job
  Svc->>FS: Create partial output
  Svc->>FF: Spawn argument vector
  Cmd-->>UI: jobId
  loop Encoding
    FF-->>Svc: progress key/value
    Svc-->>UI: export://progress
  end
  alt Cancel
    UI->>Cmd: cancel_export(jobId)
    Cmd->>Svc: terminate process tree
    Svc->>FS: remove partial
    Svc-->>UI: export://cancelled
  else Failure
    FF-->>Svc: non-zero
    Svc->>FS: remove partial
    Svc-->>UI: export://failed
  else Success
    Svc->>Probe: verify partial
    Probe-->>Svc: metadata
    Svc->>FS: atomic rename
    Svc-->>UI: export://completed
  end
